eplace an inline image by object ID with a local image file\r\n    replace-image-safe         Replace an image safely without cropping by deleting and re-inserting at the exact index\r\n    reply-comment              Reply to an existing comment on document (via Drive API)\r\n    resolve-comment            Resolve a comment\r\n    sed                        Sed-style operations: substitution, delete, append, insert, positional\r\n    share                      Share document with a user or domain\r\n    start-approval             Start a G3 Assist approval process for a document\r\n    style-table                Style cells of an existing table (background color)\r\n    style-table-columns        Set column widths of an existing table\r\n    sync                       Synchronize a local markdown file with a Google Doc\r\n    unmerge-cells              Unmerge previously merged table cells\r\n    update-table               Find a table by header row and replace its data rows\r\n    write                      Write/overwrite document content from a plain text file\r\n\r\n  readonly (Read-only operations for inspecting and exporting document content):\r\n    diff-revisions             Compare two document revisions as plain text\r\n    download-image             Download an inline image from a document by its object ID\r\n    dump-body                  Dump raw document body JSON\r\n    dump-stubby                Dump raw document JSON via Stubby (includes comments and anchors)\r\n    export                     Export document to PDF, ZIP (HTML), DOCX, TXT, MD, or PNG\r\n    extract-links              Extract all hyperlinks from a document\r\n    extract-tables             Extract all tables as structured JSON data\r\n    footnotes                  Extract document footnotes\r\n    get-url                    Generate a shareable web URL for a Google Doc (with optional tab, heading, or comment anchor)\r\n    info                       Get document info\r\n    list-comm